WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.816
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Public Speaking!

2
00:00:05.116 --> 00:00:06.909
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:07.209 --> 00:00:09.766
Today's topic is Countries of the World.

4
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:17.106
Today we practise speaking in front of friends. Stand tall, smile, and use a big voice.

5
00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:19.002
Japan!

6
00:00:19.902 --> 00:00:22.206
Japan. Your turn!

7
00:00:25.106 --> 00:00:26.443
Japan!

8
00:00:26.743 --> 00:00:27.547
Great!

9
00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:29.330
China!

10
00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.047
China. Your turn!

11
00:00:34.947 --> 00:00:35.902
China!

12
00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.261
Wonderful!

13
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.170
Thailand!

14
00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:42.107
Thailand. Your turn!

15
00:00:45.007 --> 00:00:46.020
Thailand!

16
00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:47.413
Super!

17
00:00:48.417 --> 00:00:49.975
Vietnam!

18
00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:53.887
Vietnam. Your turn!

19
00:00:56.787 --> 00:00:57.893
Vietnam!

20
00:00:58.193 --> 00:00:59.148
Excellent!

21
00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:06.555
Tip one: look at your friends. Tip two: speak slowly. Tip three: smile!

22
00:01:06.855 --> 00:01:08.135
I can do it!

23
00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:20.985
Hello, everyone! My name is Malis. Today I talk about Countries of the World. Japan is famous for sushi. France is famous for the Eiffel Tower. Thank you!

24
00:01:21.285 --> 00:01:22.913
Wonderful speech!

25
00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:32.783
Now you speak. Say hello, say your name, then say: Japan is famous for sushi. France is famous for the Eiffel Tower.

26
00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:42.665
Clap, clap, clap!

27
00:01:42.965 --> 00:01:45.396
Brave and bright! Well done!

28
00:01:46.383 --> 00:01:51.709
Great job today, everyone! See you next time. Bye-bye!

29
00:01:52.009 --> 00:01:54.020
